# Line-ending normalization.
#
# Without this file, a clone on Windows (Git's default core.autocrlf=true) checks
# shell scripts out with CRLF. bash then chokes on the trailing \r:
#     docker-entrypoint.sh: line 2: set: -\r: invalid option
#     docker-entrypoint.sh: line 13: exec: apache2-foreground\r: not found
# docker-entrypoint.sh is the `command:` for EVERY *-web-server service, so the
# container exits immediately and `restart: always` crash-loops it forever — the
# db/phpmyadmin containers come up fine, which makes it look like a hang rather
# than a failure. Keep .sh at LF regardless of platform.

* text=auto

*.sh            text eol=lf
Dockerfile      text eol=lf
*.yml           text eol=lf
*.yaml          text eol=lf
.htaccess       text eol=lf

# Binary assets — never transform.
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.webp  binary
*.ico   binary
*.mov   binary
*.mp4   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf   binary
*.otf   binary
*.zip   binary
